faces north. Travelers check Nosepass to get their bearings.",[25]="Nosepass’s magnetic nose is always pointed to the north. If two of these Pokémon meet, they cannot turn their faces to each other when they are close because their magnetic noses repel one another.",[26]="Nosepass had been said to be completely unmoving, with its magnetic nose pointed due north. However, close observation has revealed that the Pokémon actually moves by a little over 3/8 of an inch every year.",[27]="The magnet in Nosepass’s nose provides an unerring compass, making it an excellent partner for Trainers going on a journey.",[28]="It uses powerful magnetism to drag its prey toward it. It’s also been known to pull in metal, which it collects and uses to protect itself.",[29]="It moves less than an inch a year, but when it’s in a jam, it will spin and drill down into the ground in a split second.",[30]="It hunts without twitching a muscle by pulling in its prey with powerful magnetism. But sometimes it pulls natural enemies in close.",[39]="Once the people of Hisui discovered that its red nose always points north, they grew to rely on it greatly when traveling afar. The nose seems to work in a similar way to ancient compasses."},es={[23]="Siempre apunta al norte con su nariz imantada. Con ella reviste su cuerpo de objetos metálicos para protegerse.",[24]="Siempre está con el pico magnético orientado hacia el norte. Quienes viajan toman a Nosepass como referencia.",[25]="Nosepass siempre está con la nariz magnética que tiene orientada hacia el norte. Si se encuentra con otro ejemplar de su especie, no puede mirarle de frente porque sus polos magnéticos se repelen.",[26]="De Nosepass se llegó a decir que era totalmente estático; siempre con su nariz magnética orientada hacia el norte. Sin embargo, tras recientes estudios se ha visto que sí se mueve en realidad, apenas un centímetro al año.",[27]="Los Nosepass tienen una nariz brújula infalible, por lo que los Entrenadores viajeros suelen llevar uno consigo.",[28]="Atraen a sus presas usando su potente fuerza magnética. En algunos casos también atraen metales para proteger sus cuerpos.",[29]="Solo se desplaza un centímetro al año, pero, si se siente amenazado, gira sobre sí mismo y se hunde bajo tierra en un abrir y cerrar de ojos.",[30]="Su potente fuerza magnética le permite atraer a sus presas sin necesidad de moverse, aunque a veces también atrae a sus enemigos naturales."},pt="Quando o povo de Hisui descobriu que seu nariz vermelho sempre aponta para o norte, passou a depender muito dele em viagens longas. O nariz parece funcionar de forma parecida com as bússolas antigas."},evo={{s=299},{s=476,from=299,c={{t="level-up",loc=10},{t="level-up",loc=379},{t="level-up",loc=629},{t="level-up",loc=771},{t="level-up",loc=789},{t="use-item",item=83},{t="level-up",loc=446}}}},moves={[5]={1,33,7,106,13,88,16,335,22,86,28,157,31,201,37,156,43,192,46,199},[6]={1,33,7,106,13,88,16,335,22,86,28,157,31,201,37,156,43,192,46,199},[7]={1,33,7,106,13,88,16,335,22,86,28,157,31,201,37,156,43,192,46,199},[8]={1,33,7,106,13,88,19,335,25,86,31,157,37,201,43,156,49,435,55,444,61,192,67,199,73,414},[9]={1,33,7,106,13,88,19,335,25,86,31,157,37,201,43,156,49,408,55,435,61,444,67,192,73,199,79,414},[10]={1,33,7,106,13,88,19,335,25,86,31,157,37,201,43,156,49,408,55,435,61,444,67,192,73,199,79,414},[11]={1,33,7,106,13,88,19,335,25,86,31,157,37,201,43,156,49,408,55,435,61,444,67,192,73,199,79,414},[12]={1,33,7,106,13,88,16,335,22,86,28,157,31,201,37,156,43,192,46,199},[13]={1,33,7,106,13,88,16,335,22,86,28,157,31,201,37,156,43,192,46,199},[14]={1,33,4,106,8,335,11,88,15,86,18,350,22,156,25,209,29,157,32,408,36,201,39,435,43,414,46,444,50,199,50,192},[15]={1,33,4,106,8,335,11,88,15,86,18,350,22,156,25,209,29,157,32,408,36,201,39,435,43,414,46,444,50,199,50,192},[16]={1,33,4,106,7,335,10,88,13,86,16,156,19,209,22,157,25,408,28,350,31,435,34,201,37,414,40,444,43,199,43,192},[17]={1,33,4,106,7,335,10,88,13,86,16,156,19,209,22,157,25